This module implements the Mapbox Vector Tile Specification 2.1
(https://github.com/mapbox/vector-tile-spec). It contains no third-party code;
its output is compared with @mapbox/vector-tile
(https://github.com/mapbox/vector-tile-js) in the mbt-map repository.
